mingle-cli
==========

This repository packages a headless Linux command-line interface for
Mingle. It is an independent packaging project. It is not an official
Mingle product, and it is not maintained by the Mingle authors.

Mingle is copyright its authors and is released under the MIT License.
Upstream project: https://github.com/earayu/Mingle

This repository is also MIT licensed. See LICENSE.

The file icon.png is the official Mingle application icon, taken from the
public v0.4.11 tree at desktop/resources/icon.png. It is an image, not
Mingle source code.

No source code from earayu/Mingle is committed here. Official release
archives are downloaded when this package is built, checked against the
SHA256SUMS file published with that release and against the checksums
pinned in upstream.json, and then reduced to the files the headless
Node CLI needs. The desktop entry, its WebKit shell, desktop launchers,
and other GUI pieces are not packaged.

The Node.js binary included in the build output is the one shipped
inside the official Mingle Linux archive. Its license is copied from
that archive at build time and installed beside the binary.
